{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300a\u5de5\u5ec8 Warehouse\u300b</strong> is a short first-person action psychological horror game set inside a rotting Hong Kong industrial building. You\u2019re the landlord. You came to deliver rent notices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But somewhere between the fifth and seventh floor\u2026 something changes. The walls shift. The tenants get quiet. And the building starts remembering things it shouldn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/0f8acbe8d9ee16124b11e6652dd1459f.avif?t=1752740261\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras_big/0f8acbe8d9ee16124b11e6652dd1459f.avif?t=1752740261 width=800 height=404 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Psychological Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focused 60-minute descent into tension, paranoia, and guilt. No filler. Just fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/17d22eda6beffb1b284b150e8c59500d.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/17d22eda6beffb1b284b150e8c59500d.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/17d22eda6beffb1b284b150e8c59500d.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS-Style Camera View</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the flicker of a VHS lens, nothing looks quite right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/a71efc2ab530d57da8d331633588d98a.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/a71efc2ab530d57da8d331633588d98a.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/a71efc2ab530d57da8d331633588d98a.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape room horror, room by room</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor is a self-contained nightmare. Search for clues. Solve the puzzle. Open the next door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/4ac1393a6de1de27d08ad7be6306faf1.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/4ac1393a6de1de27d08ad7be6306faf1.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/4ac1393a6de1de27d08ad7be6306faf1.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun in Hand, But Never in Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a gun. So what? It won\u2019t stop the things here. It might just make them angrier.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/711aee8c02556fbfa7dc2dc1344a0284.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/711aee8c02556fbfa7dc2dc1344a0284.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/711aee8c02556fbfa7dc2dc1344a0284.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Entered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3656990/ec5aed2962c685ed618ada9f6f3f67c808cf4e4d.jpg"},{"name":"Confused","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3656990/f23aa9bcdec54b9d042dc5b34a6835e275b08c53.jpg"},{"name":"Panicked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3656990/1c7dfe2398a84a7ac7ec8443d6328ce81746a2b4.jpg"},{"name":"Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3656990/61f342e4006f8b946b6c13b42eaf4a4949fd1e3c.jpg"},{"name":"Loop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3656990/e030104097f01194f6c9602b463ee21d14202fab.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3656990?t=1752740261","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3656990?t=1752740261","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/d9e276fde3e1c340dcd8148a80c062e34b543094/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752740261","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/d9e276fde3e1c340dcd8148a80c062e34b543094/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752740261","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mature content that is not appropriate for all ages. It features frequent depictions of blood and violence, as well as themes involving murder. Viewer discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300a\u5de5\u5ec8 Warehouse\u300b</strong> is a short first-person action psychological horror game set inside a rotting Hong Kong industrial building. You\u2019re the landlord. You came to deliver rent notices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But somewhere between the fifth and seventh floor\u2026 something changes. The walls shift. The tenants get quiet. And the building starts remembering things it shouldn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/0f8acbe8d9ee16124b11e6652dd1459f.avif?t=1752740261\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras_big/0f8acbe8d9ee16124b11e6652dd1459f.avif?t=1752740261 width=800 height=404 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Psychological Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focused 60-minute descent into tension, paranoia, and guilt. No filler. Just fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/17d22eda6beffb1b284b150e8c59500d.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/17d22eda6beffb1b284b150e8c59500d.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/17d22eda6beffb1b284b150e8c59500d.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS-Style Camera View</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the flicker of a VHS lens, nothing looks quite right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/a71efc2ab530d57da8d331633588d98a.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/a71efc2ab530d57da8d331633588d98a.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/a71efc2ab530d57da8d331633588d98a.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape room horror, room by room</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor is a self-contained nightmare. Search for clues. Solve the puzzle. Open the next door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/4ac1393a6de1de27d08ad7be6306faf1.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/4ac1393a6de1de27d08ad7be6306faf1.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/4ac1393a6de1de27d08ad7be6306faf1.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun in Hand, But Never in Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a gun. So what? It won\u2019t stop the things here. It might just make them angrier.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/711aee8c02556fbfa7dc2dc1344a0284.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/711aee8c02556fbfa7dc2dc1344a0284.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/711aee8c02556fbfa7dc2dc1344a0284.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Echo Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/ad439fd8e4fccd32c49540bb8cb6d624296170e7/header.jpg?t=1752740261","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3656990/869759/e065bfee4c88c48b43c0ae96c8d57f26355858b1/1750416581/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744787935","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3656990/869759/e065bfee4c88c48b43c0ae96c8d57f26355858b1/1750416581/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744787935","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3656990/869759/e065bfee4c88c48b43c0ae96c8d57f26355858b1/1750416581/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744787935","id":257125814,"name":"\u5de5\u5ec8 Warehouse Wishlist Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125814/10029ebea39f4182a21b14d7f6be08ad268e7115/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744787935"}],"name":"\u5de5\u5ec8 Warehouse","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"defaul